      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Myles,\n           Some platform  may take more than 2s for initializing the transport, download firmware. \n          \nEarlier it was 2.9s in BT stack code for startup init timeout https://android.googlesource.com/platform/system/bt/+/refs/tags/android-platform-12.1.0_r15/hci/src/hci_layer.cc#86  (DEFAULT_STARTUP_TIMEOUT_MS 2900)   \n         \nare we using 3s for  init timeout https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/refs/heads/master:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/gd/stack_manager.cc;l\u003d48 now in latest code? \n\nIt seems that, you already did similar fix in BT APP https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/packages/apps/Bluetooth/+/687268 to fix similar issue\n\n\nCan we change init timeout value to 2.9s or 3s for BT VTS to align with stack hci init timeout?",
      "parentUuid": "470de5c6_c95045d7",
      "revId": "4858152b7b19129e5cd04b9e076476052d4f61f0",
