      "writtenOn": "2023-05-09T23:50:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In practice, we want to have some cushion between the timeout that we enforce with VTS and the timeout that we have in the Bluetooth stack for starting.  When we\u0027re running a VTS test, there are very few other things running, so it\u0027s a kind of best-case scenario.",
      "parentUuid": "55dd731c_372bdf60",
      "revId": "4858152b7b19129e5cd04b9e076476052d4f61f0",
